content.p:
Approves the summary for policymakers of the regional assessment of biodiversity and ecosystem services for Africa
IPBES/6/15/Add.1. and accepts the chapters of the assessment including their executive summaries;
IPBES/6/INF/3/Rev.1.

Also approves the summary for policymakers of the regional assessment of biodiversity and ecosystem services for the Americas
IPBES/6/15/Add.2. and accepts the chapters of the assessment including their executive summaries;
IPBES/6/INF/4/Rev.1.

Further approves the summary for policymakers of the regional assessment of biodiversity and ecosystem services for Asia and the Pacific
IPBES/6/15/Add.3. and accepts the chapters of the assessment including their executive summaries;
IPBES/6/INF/5/Rev.1.

Approves the summary for policymakers of the regional assessment of biodiversity and ecosystem services for Europe and Central Asia
IPBES/6/15/Add.4. and accepts the chapters of the assessment including their executive summaries;
IPBES/6/INF/6/Rev.1.

Approves the summary for policymakers of the thematic assessment of land degradation and restoration
IPBES/6/15/Add.5. and accepts the chapters of the thematic assessment including their executive summaries;
IPBES/6/INF/1/Rev.1.

Takes note of the report prepared by the internal review team,
IPBES/6/INF/32. and the selection of the members of the review panel to perform the review and of an external professional organization to coordinate the review;
IPBES/6/10.
